    On-On-Off-On-On-Off-On-Off
- KZPBA-CB with an externally connected RAID array 3000
- Digital Unix 4.0E
- AlphaBios 5.65
- Qlogic ISP1040B/V2 firmware 5.54

Is it in principle possible to connect internal AND external devices to
a KZPBA-CB? I couldn't find anything about that in the documentation
(the docs for the KZPBA-CA mention that either only external or internal
devices can be added).

Is it in principal possible to connect wide-differential SCSI devices
and narrow SCSI devices?

Has anyone used a KZPBA-CB for internally connecting devices to its
narrow device connection?

What about termination? There is a jumper on the HP C1537A to "provide
