I got it working now.

According to the Install documentation I had changed the CFLAGS to the following

  CFLAGS=-std -migrate -Olimit 1000 -g3 -O2 $(XCFLAGS)

After changing the CFLAGS to

  CFLAGS=-std -Olimit 1000 -g3 -O2 $(XCFLAGS)

it works.

