tells me "yes, it is capable of running Tru64 UNIX". No one has been
able to give me much specifics on why or why not, other than the fact
that the firmware on the AlphaPC motherboards don't have SRM (??). At
the same rate, no one that I've spoken to cared enough to even put
"AlphaPC" issuses in their consideration queue. Now I'm left wondering
whether the AlphaPC motherboard's firmware chip is /capable/ of holding
SRM, or only ARC (do they even use ARC?).

